{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"3026005010010","name":"摩美々","text":"──や、打ち上げとか……","trans":"──不，比如庆功会之类的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010020","name":"摩美々","text":"私はいいのにー\r\n結局、ランタン祭りに参加できてないんだし……","trans":"我倒是无所谓啦——\n毕竟最后也没能参加灯笼祭……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010030","name":"樹里","text":"『……おい、そんなこと言うなよなー』","trans":"“……喂，别说这种话啦——”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010040","name":"樹里","text":"『みんなも摩美々に\r\n打ち上げ参加してほしいって言ってたぞ？』","trans":"“大家也都说\n希望摩美美来参加庆功会哦？”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010060","name":"樹里","text":"『じゃあ、事務所で待ってるからな！』","trans":"“那就在事务所等你哦！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010070","name":"摩美々","text":"あー……\r\nんー","trans":"啊——……\n嗯——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010080","name":"樹里","text":"『待ってるからな！』","trans":"“等你哦！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010090","name":"摩美々","text":"……忘れなければ行くねー","trans":"……要是我没忘的话就去吧——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010100","name":"樹里","text":"『ははっ、うん\r\nじゃあ、また後でなー！』","trans":"“哈哈，嗯\n那待会儿见——！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010110","name":"摩美々","text":"？\r\n誰かいるー？","trans":"？\n有人吗——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010130","name":"摩美々","text":"あ────────","trans":"啊————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010160","name":"摩美々","text":"ランタン祭り、\r\n行ったんですかぁ？","trans":"灯笼祭，\n你去了吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010200","name":"ルカ","text":"行くわけねェだろ","trans":"怎么可能去啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010210","name":"摩美々","text":"……なぁんだ","trans":"……什么嘛","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010220","name":"ルカ","text":"なんで私が──────","trans":"为什么是我——————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010230","name":"摩美々","text":"──あ\r\n帰るなら、飲み物飲んでけばぁ？","trans":"──啊\n要回去的话，喝点饮料再走呗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010240","name":"ルカ","text":"いらねェっつってんだろ……","trans":"我都说了不要了吧……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010250","name":"摩美々","text":"ふふー\r\nざんねーん","trans":"呵呵——\n真遗憾——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010290","name":"真乃","text":"……摩美々ちゃん\r\nお待たせしちゃってごめんなさい","trans":"……摩美美\n让你等这么久，对不起","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010300","name":"摩美々","text":"……私も今来たところだからぁ","trans":"……我也才刚到而已——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010310","name":"樹里","text":"あっついな……\r\nお、飲み物……『ご自由にどうぞ』だって","trans":"好热啊……\n哦，饮料……写着“请随意取用”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010320","name":"樹里","text":"これ、いただくとするか","trans":"这个，我就拿一瓶了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010330","name":"摩美々","text":"あ、それ────","trans":"啊，那个────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010340","name":"樹里","text":"ん？\r\n摩美々も飲むか？","trans":"嗯？\n摩美美也要喝吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010350","name":"摩美々","text":"や、そうじゃなくて────","trans":"不，不是那个意思────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010360","name":"樹里","text":"う、うわっ……！","trans":"哇、哇……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010370","name":"樹里","text":"噴き出した……！","trans":"喷出来了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010380","name":"摩美々","text":"おー……\r\n完璧じゃーん","trans":"哦——……\n这不是完美吗——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010390","name":"樹里","text":"まっ、摩美々～～！\r\nはめたな！？","trans":"摩、摩美美～～！\n你算计我！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010400","name":"摩美々","text":"ほらぁ、暑いし\r\n炭酸浴びて、涼しくなったでしょー？","trans":"你看，天这么热\n被碳酸喷一下，凉快了吧——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010410","name":"樹里","text":"あー、なるほど……","trans":"啊——，原来如此……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010420","name":"樹里","text":"ってなんねーから！","trans":"才不会凉快呢！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010450","name":"あさひ","text":"待つっす！","trans":"我会等的！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010460","name":"あさひ","text":"ダンス、踊ってみたっすけど……\r\nなんかルカちゃんと同じにならないっす","trans":"我试着跳了舞……\n但总觉得和路加不一样","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010470","name":"あさひ","text":"なんでっすかね？","trans":"这是为什么呢？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010490","name":"ルカ","text":"──────\r\nくだらね……","trans":"——————\n真无聊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3026005010500","name":"あさひ","text":"────あれ\r\nいっちゃったっす","trans":"————咦\n她走了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}